    "name": "Impulse Responses Mono",
    "vendor": "LSP CLAP",
    "version": "1.0.35",
    "doc": "This plugin performs highly optimized real time zero-latency convolution to the input signal. It can be used as a cabinet emulator, some sort of equalizer or as a reverb simulation plugin. All what is needed is audio file with impulse response taken from the linear system (cabinet, equalizer or hall/room).",
